sentences.text:
(i) the petitioners shall abide by their undertaking for encash  ment of the post dated cheques;
(ii) in the event of any default, not only the order granting interim protection against arrest to the petitioners shall be recalled, they shall be liable to be prosecuted under the Contempt of Courts Act;
(iii) the complainant agrees to take necessary steps to relinquish his rights in the apartment as may be jointly resolved, without waiting for the date of encashment of the post dated cheques;
(iv) the complainant shall, as per the agreed settlement, withdraw all the civil and criminal cases filed against the petitioners.

